---
import result from "../assets/ios-result.png";
---
<section id="workflow" class="section workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
  <p class="section-kicker">工作方式 / THE WORKFLOW</p>
  <h2 id="workflow-title">从交给它开始，<br class="mobile-break" />到把结果带回来。</h2>
  <p class="workflow-example">以跨端文件检查为例</p>
  <div class="steps">
    <article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>交给它开始</h3><p>在合适的机器上启动任务，沿用已有的项目、工具和数据连接。</p><div class="sample task-sample" aria-label="文件检查流程示例"><span>检查项目文件</span><span class="tag">电脑上开始 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></article>
    <article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>离开后继续</h3><p>在沙发上、地铁里查看进展，补充要求，在需要时参与。</p><div class="sample message-sample"><span class="sample-label">手机 · 补充文件</span><span>你好 O'Brien.md</span></div></article>
    <article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>回来时查看结果</h3><p>查看代码、文档与验证报告，检查结果，继续处理剩余工作。</p><div class="sample result-sample"><span>附件内容已输出到终端</span><a href={result.src}>查看终端输出实拍 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
  </div>
</section>
